WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:05.860
Toys. They are miraculous buds that swell from the hearts of the chosen.

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:12.320
Some flowers are born pure, while others bloom laced with poison.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.200
The Age of Detectives.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.490
The two flowers, vying for beauty.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:24.330
Their names are the Detective and the Phantom Thief.

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:16.610
<i>We lost our Toys, and were driven out of our private rooms...</i>

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:19.610
<i>...and yet our lives go on.</i>

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:42.050
<i>We were always so close...</i>

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:45.810
<i>It all just seems like a dream now...</i>

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:49.480
<i>That's it!</i>

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:55.570
Milky Holmes is restarting, so I can't think selfishly! We've gotta help each other out here!

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:57.900
Morning!

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:01.200
My Mega Cheeto!

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:02.870
Give some to me too!

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:05.200
No! That's the last one I have left!

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:09.080
I skipped dinner... my stomach is...

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.800
Don't act this way! We need to come together and help each other out of this!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:17.960
Stop it!

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:24.640
Well then, here is today's news and weather report in Yokohama.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:27.350
Don't fight!!

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:30.600
My Mega Cheeto was...!

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.560
What are you doing, Cordelia?!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:35.940
Let's suck it up!

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:40.110
I was just trying to stop the fighting...

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:43.570
Last night, Phantom Thief Arsène appeared in the Enoshima Art Museum.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:46.660
She has stolen the national treasure, "Dawn of Enoshima."

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.330
"Dawn of Enoshima..."

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:50.540
Beautiful!

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.290
Not as beautiful as me, of course.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:57.500
Now that Milky Holmes is out of the way, our work has become so easy that it's almost boring now.

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.340
Good work.

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:19.320
However, Milky Holmes <i>is</i> the team that was trained by the great detective Kobayashi Opera.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:21.530
We can't assume that they won't make a comeback.

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:23.570
Shall we "buy some insurance?"

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:24.990
Leave it to us.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:41.090
Could this be our breakfast?

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:41.800
Is there a problem?

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.970
Another serving of bread here, please!

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:46.470
Yes, right away.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:57.100
There's no bread for students with no Toys!

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:02.070
I feel so sorry for Milky Holmes! Not being able to eat such great bread...!

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:05.070
If you feel that way, then gimme some bread!

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:05.910
Nero!

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:08.490
Don't! Just bear with it!

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:13.410
As if I could do that! I'd sell my soul to the devil just to eat some bread!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:18.540
It's so fluffy and soft. Yummy~

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.960
Damn...

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.890
Not enough! Gimme yours too, Sher!

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:32.680
What are you doing?! I wouldn't give it to you, even if you begged!

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:33.600
Give it!

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:35.770
Don't fig-

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:38.520
My potato!

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:39.690
That's <i>my</i> potato!

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:42.610
What did you do that for, Cordelia?!

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.410
Why is this so worn out?

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:54.870
There are no first-class tables for students with no Toys!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.540
Cordelia-san! There are some mushrooms―

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:11.680
Class! Your beautiful teacher's fine arts lesson is about to start!

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:15.100
Now, behold! Then draw!

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:20.480
Ah, here too!

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:24.730
Lucky! I was really starving!

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:27.530
This is a <i>suillus bovinus</i>.

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.570
That is an <i>entoloma sarcopum</i>.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:32.580
They're edible, right?

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:33.660
Next is...

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:36.200
Behold my back and draw!

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:40.330
We mustn't! We're in the middle of class!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.830
Itadakimasu!

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:42.380
Wait!

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.040
Not raw.

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:48.670
You're good, Cordelia!

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.470
But how do we light it?

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:53.720
Now, for those who want to draw my side!

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:56.060
You'll only have three minutes! Hurry!

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:02.350
Go go, Cordelia-san!

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.440
I can't go on!

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:05.980
Don't give up!

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.440
You're almost there! Keep going!

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.070
Go go go!

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:10.910
Please keep going...

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:15.080
<i>This is it, this is it!</i>

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:18.450
<i>The moment when our hearts become as one!</i>

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.830
Jeez, it's painful to watch you guys!

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:27.460
Oh yeah, Nezu-kun, you use a fire-type Toys, right?

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:32.050
Aww... so you're having fun showing off your Toys like that?

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:34.050
Hey! At least show some thanks!

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:37.180
Thank-you-ve-ry-much.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:40.020
Sher, flip those mushrooms over.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.100
Okay.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.690
What should we season it with?

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.820
Nezu-kun, could you bring out some salt?

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:48.570
Huh?

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:50.400
I'll have soy sauce.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.650
As if!

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:53.490
Seven Spices...

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:54.990
In that case...

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:55.780
Hey!

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:59.330
For what reason are you kids not looking at my beautiful figure?!

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:00.120
Uh oh!

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.290
Spank of love!!

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:04.000
Ouch!

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:05.630
Spank of love!

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:06.380
Ow!

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.500
Spank of ♥!

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:08.590
Ahh!

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:10.340
Dammit, why me too?!

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:13.010
You did not look at me. That is a sin!

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:17.600
The mushrooms got taken away, huh...

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:20.100
They were so close to being grilled, too...

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:23.850
That's not good, Cordelia! Your senses are too dull!

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:26.980
Why didn't you notice that the teacher was coming?

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:29.530
We <i>did</i> start grilling in the middle of the classroom, so...

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:33.110
You destroy snacks. You eat people's potatoes.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.860
That was <i>my</i> potato!

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:37.030
That's because I tried to stop you two from fighting...

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:39.490
You're useless without your Toys, Cordelia!

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:45.000
<i>Milky Holmes must get along from now on...</i>

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:48.380
About those flowers on your hair... is there any point to them?

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.040
Huh?

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.880
You've got a flowerbed growing in your head or something?

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:56.010
Ahh, I've had enough! I've been trying to keep it together, too!

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:59.350
It's falling apart already! Useless Cordelia!

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:00.560
Uselessless Nero!

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:02.180
Uselesslessless Cordelia!

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:03.730
Uselesslesslessless Nero!

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:05.730
What a useless argument...

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:08.440
Ow...

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:16.780
Herc, let's go.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:18.120
Y-Yeah!

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:19.200
Wait for me!

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.160
I'm so useless, huh...

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.130
Nero?

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:30.290
Herc-san?

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.340
Nero!

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.130
Why am I even looking here...

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:41.560
Nero turned into a cat!

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:44.060
Herc-san isn't with you?

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.940
Why am I even asking?

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:55.860
You'll get a cold if you stay here.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:02.620
You must be hungry, right?

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:12.800
Why did it turn out like this...

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:23.220
Welcome back!

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:25.850
What's with that animal?

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:28.690
I picked him up. His name's Kamaboko.

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:29.940
Kamaboko?

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:32.980
His fur is white, and the soles of his paws are pink!

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:35.400
See, isn't he coloured just like a <i>kamaboko</i> ?

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:37.070
Are you hungry?

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:39.780
All right, I'll catch some fish for you tomorrow!

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:42.070
But pets are prohibited here...

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:44.410
It'll be fine if we keep it a secret!

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:50.250
He really loves being with people, eh?

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:52.630
If it's about animals, then leave it to me!

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.380
What did he just say?

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:56.170
Well...

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:00.260
This is...

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:05.260
My flowerbed!

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:16.190
The operation is going well.

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:19.610
They feel like crap, and their teamwork's a mess.

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:24.490
Soon they'll be dis-ban-ded! Woo!

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:28.040
They are cheerfully walking together to school, though.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:36.500
Unbelievable!

00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:40.840
Stay still, Kamaboko!

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:45.260
Ah, wait for me!

00:11:57.440 --> 00:12:02.820
<i>Everyone was able to get along today, too.</i>

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:14.170
<i>Thanks, Kamaboko. It's all thanks to you.</i>

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.590
Cordelia-san...

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:20.130
Did I wake you up? Sorry about that.

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:21.880
Let's get some sleep.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:27.930
I brought it out to the fields, you know.

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:28.720
My Kamaboko...!

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:34.810
What's with them? They did nothing but fight yesterday, yet now...

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:42.400
Even though they had nothing but potatoes, why are they so...

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.820
The bread is gone!

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:51.330
Ahh, I'm so happy with my stomach full.

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:53.870
You're right.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:57.670
You damn bread thieves!

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.000
Bread thieves?

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:03.050
Bread?

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:04.010
Potato?

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:06.220
What's wrong, Ishinagare-san?

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:07.840
They have stolen bread.

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:11.350
Eh?! We didn't do any―

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:12.600
You said it yourself!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:16.350
<i>I'd sell my soul to the devil just to eat some bread!</i>

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:18.940
You were loitering around outside the kitchen!

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:20.020
<i>You must be hungry, eh?</i>

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.530
You just said that you were full!

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.950
You don't say "no" to anything bad that they ask you to do!

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:31.620
Therefore, they are bread thieves!

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.580
You're wrong! It was Kamaboko who―

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:34.330
Sher!

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:37.420
Did you even try and steal some <i>kamaboko</i> ?!

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:39.080
What's the matter?

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.670
They have stolen bread!

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:44.630
You're wrong! We would never do such a―

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:52.810
Hold it!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.650
So this cat is the criminal, huh?

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.280
Kamaboko!

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:08.740
Don't go!

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:13.240
If we lose Kamaboko, then Milky Holmes will...

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.620
Our flowerbed will...

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:16.960
What's wrong?

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:28.010
Undeniably, the one who hath done the deed:

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:35.770
'Tis I, possess'd by unknown demons to plunder thine bread!

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:38.190
I have stolen the bread!

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:40.650
Ehh?!

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:54.080
It is I who has stolen the bread!

00:14:55.870 --> 00:15:02.710
Cordelia-san!

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:06.000
Cordelia-san would never do such a thing, would she?!

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:09.220
Too bad for you, Cordelia.

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:15.010
This is wrong! Cordelia-san would never do such a thing!

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:16.010
It's all right.

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:19.940
Sherlock Shellingford...

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:21.520
Eh, but...

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:25.400
It's all right. I have protected our flowerbed.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:26.650
Flowerbed?

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:27.610
Huh?

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:32.240
Don't mind me. It's fine if you are all happy.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.990
But do remember it once in awhile, okay?

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:38.410
That there was a flower who died nobly in your stead...

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.000
Ahh, forget what I said!

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:44.040
I just want you all to be happy together...

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.210
Huh...

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:46.380
Time's up.

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:47.670
Cordelia-san!

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:48.380
C'mon.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:51.300
Don't mind me.

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:52.470
Cordelia-san!

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:56.640
Everyone, get along with Kamaboko!

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:02.690
Cordelia-san's going to be expelled?!

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:08.900
Of course. For someone aiming to be a detective, stealing is something that they must never do.

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:10.530
Expelled...

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:13.910
Cordelia-san would never be a bread thief!

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:15.120
This conversation is over.

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:16.740
Henriette-san!

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:20.620
But Cordelia did say herself that she did it, so...

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.830
There must have been a reason for it!

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.290
What kind of reason?

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.420
I don't know...

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:28.170
You don't know?

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:33.340
Detectives who speak such words have indeed fallen far.

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:34.720
<i>Detectives!</i>

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:40.680
That's it! All we have to do is solve this mystery!

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:44.560
I don't really care whether Cordelia gets expelled or not, though...

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:45.850
That's a lie!

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:48.610
Milky Holmes, commence operation!

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:57.950
So you did it, right?

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:58.950
I-I didn't-oink!

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:00.950
Close your eyes!

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:02.870
Everyone who just did that, raise your hands!

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:05.790
If they close their eyes...

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:08.130
They wouldn't be able to see my beauty, would they?!

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:12.170
I told you!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:13.800
It's impossible...

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:15.760
It's too early to give up just yet!

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:16.890
Ehh?!

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:20.850
The criminal shall surely return to the scene of the crime!

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:23.600
It's here.

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:26.520
They could have left clues here.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:38.110
Um...

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:39.200
Eh?

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:44.370
Bread crumbs.

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:49.290
That way.

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.090
This is...

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:03.970
This is it!

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:07.190
I got it! The real criminals were us!

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:08.900
Err, why though?

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:12.190
No matter how you look at it, isn't this proof that Cordelia did it?!

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:19.950
Could it be... that the real criminal's inside...?

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:27.080
Kamaboko!

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:31.670
So you were the criminal!

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:34.340
Now that I think of it, I found you at <i>that</i> place when I picked you up!

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:35.840
Jeez!

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:39.010
No matter how hungry you are, you shouldn't steal!

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:49.190
Is this us?

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:51.860
Probably...

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:53.440
They don't look like us though...

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:56.860
Now that you mention it, at that time Cordelia-san said...

00:18:57.570 --> 00:19:01.820
<i>Thanks, Kamaboko. It's all thanks to you.</i>

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:03.780
<i>So cute!</i>

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:08.370
So Cordelia took the blame for Kamaboko...

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:13.170
...because she thought that without Kamaboko, we'd be back to fighting again...

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:14.540
Cordelia-san!

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:16.170
So that's what it was...

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:18.380
What...?

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:27.680
And so everyone lived happily together tomorrow as well.

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:35.190
They forever locked their memories of the sadly yet beautifully fallen Cordelia within a beautiful box.

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:44.160
And so she... and so she bravely stood against her fate, her appearance like that of...

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:47.370
Her appearance like that of... yes...

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:49.540
Jeanne d'Arc!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:51.250
Cordelia Glauca.

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:52.120
Yes?

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:54.580
You are being released.

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:57.340
Yes...

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:01.220
Cordelia-san!

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.050
Thank goodness... thank goodness...

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:04.890
Um...

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:08.140
The truth has been clarified.

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:10.560
This cat was the criminal, right?

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:11.100
Eh?

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:15.940
Harboring a criminal and perjury...

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:19.230
As detectives, these are things that cannot be forgiven. However...

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:23.610
We were about to throw things out of order ourselves by making a false accusation.

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:27.580
As detectives, this is also something that cannot ever be forgiven.

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:30.750
I am ashamed to not have noticed that it was actually the doings of this cat.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:34.210
To think that my insight was actually this undeveloped...

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:35.130
Disappointing!

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.170
Impossible!

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:37.290
Unbearable!

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:41.420
Everyone makes mistakes!

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.630
Also, keeping pets is prohibited.

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:46.590
No way!

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:49.140
We beg you! He'll never trouble anyone again!

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:50.390
Please!

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:53.600
P... Please...!

00:20:55.480 --> 00:21:01.280
However, if that cat has already settled down in the attic, then I suppose it can't be helped.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:07.120
Which means...!

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:10.870
Thank you so much! We love you, Student Council President!

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:23.050
A moment of blunder! The blunder of my life!

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:24.470
Jeez...

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:29.300
Because you jumped to conclusions, Henriette-sama's scheme was ruined!

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:30.260
That's right!

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:33.140
Be ashamed.

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:34.270
That goes for you too...

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:42.570
I love... oh Caramel... that's...

00:23:17.740 --> 00:23:21.010
The Milky Holmes were not the bread thieves. They are innocent!

00:23:21.010 --> 00:23:24.770
That's right! I'm the sinner here! And it's because I've committed all seven deadly sins!

00:23:24.770 --> 00:23:25.400
Seven?

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:28.380
Yup! The first is that I'm too beautiful! The second is that I'm too beautiful!

00:23:28.380 --> 00:23:29.540
You shouldn't have asked...

00:23:29.540 --> 00:23:32.540
Only those with beauty greater than mine can punish me for my sins!

00:23:32.540 --> 00:23:34.430
That means... Henriette-sama! You may flay him!

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:35.820
There! His spirit's coming out!

00:23:35.820 --> 00:23:38.330
Oh yeah, go!!

00:23:38.330 --> 00:23:39.790
Looks like he went to heaven...

00:23:39.790 --> 00:23:41.380
May he rest in peace.

00:23:41.380 --> 00:23:43.670
Next time: Terror in the Coffin.

00:23:43.670 --> 00:23:46.420
The culprit is me. Teehee~
